{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/label_33.json","id":4290,"nhanesId":"1-000-9673-00","bundleName":"","fullName":"Amplified N.O. Loaded Fruit Punch","brandName":"GNC Pro Performance AMP Advanced Muscle Performance","brandIpSymbol":"®","upcSku":"0 48107 08719 7","productVersionCode":"CODE 351138 HKG","pdf":"","thumbnail":"","servingsPerContainer":"45","hasOuterCarton":false,"percentDvFootnote":"Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet","labelRelationships":[{"type":"Image difference, same product","labelId":2915},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":5861}],"contacts":[{"contactId":1193,"text":"For More Information:","types":["Other"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_1.json","id":1193,"name":"","streetAddress":"","city":"","state":"","country":"","zipCode":"","phoneNumber":"1-888-462-2548","email":"","webAddress":""}},{"contactId":1214,"text":"Distributed by:","types":["Distributor"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_1.json","id":1214,"name":"General Nutrition Corporation","streetAddress":"","city":"Pittsburgh","state":"PA","country":"","zipCode":"15222","phoneNumber":"","email":"","webAddress":""}},{"contactId":1249,"text":"SHOP NOW @","types":["Other"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_1.json","id":1249,"name":"","streetAddress":"","city":"","state":"","country":"","zipCode":"","phoneNumber":"","email":"","webAddress":"GNC.COM"}}],"netContents":[{"order":1,"quantity":2.18,"unit":"lb","display":"2.18 lb"},{"order":2,"quantity":34.86,"unit":"oz.","display":"34.86 oz."},{"order":3,"quantity":990,"unit":"g","display":"990 g"}],"physicalState":{"langualCode":"E0162","langualCodeDescription":"Powder"},"servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":22,"maxQuantity":22,"minDailyServings":1,"maxDailyServings":1,"unit":"Gram(s)","notes":"1 scoop","inSFB":true}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"productType":{"langualCode":"A1325","langualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"statements":[{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary supplement"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS: As a dietary supplement, mix one scoop (22g) in 14 oz of cold water before weight training. For best results, take on empty stomach."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Take before exercise to see and feel the results...More reps, longer sets, massive bursts of energy...now that’s an AMPlified workout."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"EFAM (Energizing Fatty Acid Metaholizer Blend) - combines 400 mg of caffeine, MCT’s and L-carnitine to generate physical and mental intensity.*"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Micronized nitric oxide formula"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Total Caffeine per serving is 400 mg."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Arginine is a key ingredient in any N.O. formula, but we don't stop there. GNC’s sports nutrition experts and scientific researchers have developed a formula combining arginine with additional N.O. potentiating ingredients to fuel your performance and boost your workouts!*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Clinically Researched"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"CODE 351138 HKG"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Creatine Matrix Blend - volumizes muscle cells.* Consists of three forms of creatine, which play an important role in muscle protein synthesis.* This blend features the three amino acids the body uses to make creatine. This blend also includes Guanidinoacetate (GAA) to help support the body's natural production of creatine.*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"During exercise when your muscles are hard at work, blood vessels expand and nitric oxide is released, allowing blood to surge throughout your body. As blood vessels expand, more blood carrying valuable nutrients surges to the muscles, delivering more nutrients to each muscle cell. When the muscles are able to receive more nutrients quicker, that is when you see outstanding performance."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Natural + artificial flavors"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Generates Increase in Muscle Power*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Micronized Arginine tor Fast Absorption"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Not only will you see the difference, you will feel the difference you will feel the difference with each dose you take."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NOTICE: Significant product settling may occur."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Pre- Workout Power Strength Energy"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"The Proof is in the Pump"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Triggers Physical & Mental Intensity*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Volumizes Muscle Cells & Improves Strength*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"When do I take it?"},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"WARNING: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, under 18 years of age or have a medical condition. Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Amplified N.O. Loaded is not your typical nitric oxide (N.O.) product - it intensifies your workout with faster N.O. activation, taking you above and beyond, pushing you to the next level. Scientifically engineered to include ingredients of the highest quality that, when combined, create a dynamic nitric oxide experience."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Amplified N.O. Loaded(TM) - What's the 'pump' all about?"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Amplified N.O. Loaded(TM) Evolution"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Amplified N.O. Loaded(TM) is what the name implies...a loaded formula guaranteed to intensify your workouts like never before! Consisting of four proprietary blends to truly make this product unique — there is no other product like it."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"In addition to our innovative technology, our skilled researchers incorporated clinically studied ingredients to give you the ultimate advantage. Clinically studied grape seed extract, MegaNatural(R)-BP(TM), acts as a hemodynamic endothelial modulator causing an increase in blood flow to the muscles. This grape seed extract activates nitric oxide synthase, which is the enzyme in the body that dilates blood vessels and ignites N.O. synthesis in the muscles. With an increased blood flow pumping to your muscles, more nutrients are delivered faster, and you will see increases in performance.*"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"MegaNatural(R)-BP(TM)"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"N.O. Charge Blend - combines arginine, citrulline and yohimbe with a clinically studied grape seed extract for an intense pre-workout boost. This unique blend was engineered using our new and innovative technology, MicroSorb(TM) Amino Technology, for superior absorption and increased efficiency. This technology takes the large arginine molecules and reduces them into smaller particles, which in turn facilitates faster absorption in the body."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"So, the question remains - is this a product for you? Well, if you're looking for a product for more explosive performance to give you a stronger competitive edge, then look no further. Amplified N.O. Loaded(TM) will give you the rush you crave to extend and maximize the efficiency of your workout.*"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Tri-MG Accelerator(TM) - includes beta-alanine and BCAA's for muscle support, as well as clinically studied betaine (Trimethylglycine) to assist in athletic performance.*"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Who should take Amplified N.O. Loaded(TM)?"},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Zero Sugar"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"MegaNatural(R)-BP(TM) and its logo are trademarks of Constellation Wines U.S., Inc."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2012-01-25","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":284519,"description":null,"notes":null,"quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":22,"operator":"=","quantity":5,"unit":"Calorie(s)","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedRows":[],"name":"Calories","category":"other","ingredientGroup":"Calories","uniiCode":"1","alternateNames":[],"forms":[]},{"order":2,"ingredientId":283702,"description":null,"notes":null,"quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":22,"operator":"=","quantity":1,"unit":"Gram(s)","dailyValueTargetGroup":[{"name":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","operator":"=","percent":0,"footnote":null}],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedRows":[{"order":3,"ingredientId":283681,"de